        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, natural gas, at power plant
na;
UUID: 790e4977-2ef9-35f5-a111-d661b873de43
The module calls the module "natural gas, burned in power plant", CENTREL, which in turn includes fuel input from high pressure (CZ, HU, SH) network, infrastructure, emissions, and substances needed for operation. The module uses the average net efficiency of natural gas power plants in CENTREL (estimated from IEA 2001, including countries CZ, HU, PL, SK).
Location: undefined
Technology: Average of installed power plants.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_790e4977-2ef9-35f5-a111-d661b873de43.xml</text>
